WEBVTT

00:00:01.252 --> 00:00:05.464
Please keep what I'm about to sing

00:00:06.924 --> 00:00:08.926
<i>Just between us, okay?</i>

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:14.724
<i>The truth is, I want to keep my
desires hidden deep in my heart</i>

00:00:14.807 --> 00:00:16.851
<i>A secret, a secret</i>

00:00:33.117 --> 00:00:35.703
<i>I</i> want <i>to take shortcuts</i>

00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:39.582
<i>Never getting soaked by the rain</i>

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:43.211
<i>Never getting knocked over by the wind</i>

00:00:43.294 --> 00:00:47.006
<i>Even if that's being devious, smile</i>

00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:51.469
<i>Even if I'm a coward, play with me</i>

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.056
<i>I don't</i> want <i>to feel sad</i>

00:00:55.139 --> 00:00:58.935
<i>Never getting soaked by tears</i>

00:00:59.018 --> 00:01:02.563
<i>Never feeling at my wit's end</i>

00:01:02.647 --> 00:01:06.025
<i>Just smile and think I'm insensitive</i>

00:01:06.108 --> 00:01:11.072
<i>Only tell me about fun things</i>

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:19.372
<i>See, there are faces I</i> want <i>to
see and voices I</i> want <i>to hear</i>

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:24.252
<i>When I wake up I trumpet my joy:</i>

00:01:24.335 --> 00:01:30.299
Good morning!
Let's have another fine day!

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:30.967
"Princess Jellyfish"

00:01:31.884 --> 00:01:33.678
Let's make one!

00:01:33.761 --> 00:01:36.555
Let's make a jellyfish dress!

00:01:36.639 --> 00:01:40.226
And then use the money to buy this place!

00:01:43.145 --> 00:01:48.109
What? You want to go home?
Right now? As fast as possible?

00:01:48.192 --> 00:01:51.070
I don't know what put the
idea into my father's head,

00:01:51.153 --> 00:01:54.448
but I need to personally explain to
him that there's nothing between us.

00:01:54.532 --> 00:01:55.825
I'll come along.

00:01:55.908 --> 00:01:56.659
No, you won't.

00:01:56.701 --> 00:01:58.744
Oh yes I will.

00:02:06.085 --> 00:02:07.545
--Wow, I've never been chauffeured before!

00:02:07.545 --> 00:02:10.047
--You dropped the ball, Sugi my man.
--Wow, I've never been chauffeured before!

00:02:10.131 --> 00:02:11.882
Yo! Clara here!

00:02:11.966 --> 00:02:16.304
Hanamori doesn't realize that
he's the one who dropped the ball!

00:02:16.387 --> 00:02:20.099
Always be careful when you use
your incoming calls list to dial a number!

00:02:22.518 --> 00:02:24.645
That you, Sugi?

00:02:24.729 --> 00:02:28.065
Oh, I just can't believe I'll get
to meet Mr. Koibuchi in person!

00:02:28.149 --> 00:02:30.901
I'll have to be on my best behavior!

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:35.906
What exactly is it that you want?

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:42.038
Shu, traffic is light today.
We'll be there in less than five minutes.

00:02:43.497 --> 00:02:44.999
Would you please just go home?

00:02:45.082 --> 00:02:47.752
Step on it, driver!

00:02:47.835 --> 00:02:49.045
Roget

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:52.089
"Midnight Pureboy"

00:02:52.965 --> 00:02:54.842
That was a good bath!

00:02:54.925 --> 00:02:57.595
Oh, say, would you like some of this?

00:02:57.595 --> 00:02:58.637
" Kantei "

00:02:59.847 --> 00:03:03.100
That's a bottle of "Kantei"
Shaoxing wine, an homage to Guan Yu!

00:03:03.184 --> 00:03:06.187
Really? It's normal sweet sake inside, though.

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:08.064
Our next-door neighbors are moving,

00:03:08.147 --> 00:03:10.608
and they were kind enough to let us have this.

00:03:10.691 --> 00:03:17.823
They're leaving? But the gentleman there...
was aging so beautifully...

00:03:17.907 --> 00:03:20.701
Apparently they've bought
a house in the suburbs.

00:03:20.785 --> 00:03:25.790
Don't tell me those cowards
have fallen for the vixen's tricks!

00:03:25.873 --> 00:03:29.585
What?! You mean she pressured them to sell?!

00:03:29.668 --> 00:03:34.006
Man, there are lots of
different types of jellyfish, huh?

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:38.803
Um... Would you mind
staying dressed as a woman?

00:03:38.886 --> 00:03:41.806
Aw, but it's too cold in these!

00:03:41.889 --> 00:03:45.267
It's fine during the day,
but at night I'm just freezing.

00:03:45.351 --> 00:03:48.521
But still, your clothes are way lame.

00:03:48.604 --> 00:03:51.232
Even I don't look good in them...

00:03:51.315 --> 00:03:53.609
Th-Then please don't wear them.

00:03:53.692 --> 00:03:57.279
Anyway, a "jellyfish dress"...

00:03:59.281 --> 00:04:01.283
Let me borrow that a sec.

00:04:02.034 --> 00:04:03.577
Okay, how about...

00:04:03.661 --> 00:04:06.997
This--what is it? This colorful one.

00:04:07.081 --> 00:04:11.710
We could use this jelly as the motif...
and do a skirt like this...

00:04:14.296 --> 00:04:16.090
Why?!

00:04:17.591 --> 00:04:20.803
It's all wrong! It's all wrong!

00:04:20.886 --> 00:04:22.179
You said that twice!

00:04:22.263 --> 00:04:24.682
That might as well be a scyphozoan.

00:04:24.765 --> 00:04:28.227
The jelly in this photo is a
flower hat jelly, which is a hydrozoan,

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:32.523
so the bell is thin, thin,
thin like glasswork in fact,

00:04:32.606 --> 00:04:35.025
and the tentacles are slender,
slender and extremely delicate--

00:04:35.109 --> 00:04:38.654
beautiful like glasswork, in fact!

00:04:38.737 --> 00:04:41.157
You totally said that twice!

00:04:44.201 --> 00:04:47.079
The flower hat... the flower hat is...

00:04:48.539 --> 00:04:50.708
The flower hat is like this!

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:03.512
I'll take one.

00:05:03.554 --> 00:05:04.305
Huh?

00:05:04.346 --> 00:05:06.056
Man, if I saw something like this,

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:08.309
I'd damn well bring it home
with me, no matter how much it cost!

00:05:08.392 --> 00:05:12.897
Look, flower hat jellies are delicate,
so you can't keep them as pets--

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:16.650
Bath's free!

00:05:16.734 --> 00:05:19.487
Oh, Fake-Boob Woman's still here?

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:22.281
She's just about to go home!

00:05:23.991 --> 00:05:25.659
Where are we going?

00:05:25.743 --> 00:05:29.038
My place. We're having a
strategy session in my room!

00:05:30.539 --> 00:05:36.545
Y-Your place... your house would in
other words have your b-b-brother...!

00:05:36.629 --> 00:05:42.635
Oh, don't worry about him!
He seems really busy lately.

00:05:42.718 --> 00:05:44.762
He's out somewhere tonight, too.

00:05:44.845 --> 00:05:47.848
O-Oh... I see...

00:05:47.932 --> 00:05:51.852
And anyway, Shu thinks
"Before" Tsukimi and "After" Tsukimi

00:05:51.936 --> 00:05:54.605
are different people...

00:05:56.941 --> 00:06:02.279
Stay in the car until I'm done
speaking with my father, all right?

00:06:02.363 --> 00:06:06.867
You only approached me to get to my father,

00:06:06.951 --> 00:06:11.205
so I'll introduce him to you. And after that...

00:06:11.288 --> 00:06:15.167
Please leave me alone once and for all.

00:06:21.465 --> 00:06:26.178
So that's what you think of me...

00:06:26.262 --> 00:06:29.139
No, uh... wait...

00:06:29.223 --> 00:06:33.936
Very well. Go ahead.

00:06:34.019 --> 00:06:35.813
All right.

00:06:45.531 --> 00:06:48.200
Please wipe your face with this, quickly.

00:06:48.284 --> 00:06:52.830
I don't want any tears or snot to
get on the seats. That's real leather.

00:06:52.913 --> 00:06:56.292
Huh? There's a car in front of the gate...

00:06:56.375 --> 00:07:01.005
What? D-D-Don't tell me it's
a b-b-brotherly sort of person?!

00:07:01.088 --> 00:07:03.591
No, it's Hanamori and...

00:07:03.674 --> 00:07:05.009
Who's that?

00:07:05.092 --> 00:07:08.762
A woman?

00:07:08.846 --> 00:07:10.639
Huh?

00:07:11.307 --> 00:07:12.558
Who are you?

00:07:12.641 --> 00:07:16.854
Tsukimi, it's that Iandshark...

00:07:16.937 --> 00:07:17.896
...isn't it?

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:21.108
Oh, you're from Amamizu-kan!

00:07:21.191 --> 00:07:24.612
Hanamori! What the hell is going on here?!

00:07:24.695 --> 00:07:27.489
Why's she in our car?

00:07:27.906 --> 00:07:31.243
Hanamori! Benz! Ten-yen coin! Ten-yen scrape!

00:07:31.327 --> 00:07:32.578
She's a friend of Shu's.

00:07:32.661 --> 00:07:35.706
I fetched them at her home
and brought them both back.

00:07:35.789 --> 00:07:37.750
She's with Shu...?

00:07:40.502 --> 00:07:42.254
Kuranosuke!

00:07:45.215 --> 00:07:48.177
Bro... Explain this!

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:50.512
What are you doing with the Iandshark chick?

00:07:50.596 --> 00:07:53.098
What are you doing?

00:07:53.182 --> 00:07:54.975
Hello.

00:07:55.059 --> 00:07:59.104
Thank you for your kindness
to my son. I'm his father.

00:08:04.985 --> 00:08:08.072
I'm pleased to meet you. Here, my card.

00:08:08.155 --> 00:08:11.283
Yes, I know who you are.

00:08:11.367 --> 00:08:16.080
I must apologize for my appearance,
and for not offering you a seat inside,

00:08:16.163 --> 00:08:18.374
but my son insisted that we do things this way.

00:08:18.457 --> 00:08:19.583
It's all right...

00:08:19.667 --> 00:08:22.961
Well? I'll just come right out and ask.

00:08:23.045 --> 00:08:26.799
Miss lnari, have you and Shu...

00:08:31.261 --> 00:08:33.972
...made it to home base?

00:08:39.812 --> 00:08:43.440
Yes...

00:08:43.524 --> 00:08:47.277
We've been united in spirit and flesh.

00:08:47.361 --> 00:08:48.946
He ran away!

00:08:50.614 --> 00:08:52.408
Tsukimi!

00:08:53.784 --> 00:08:57.079
Don't believe her, Tsukimi!
You can't let her fool you!

00:08:57.162 --> 00:08:59.665
The woman's lying!

00:08:59.748 --> 00:09:00.541
Lying?

00:09:00.624 --> 00:09:05.337
He wouldn't have! He definitely wouldn't have!

00:09:05.421 --> 00:09:07.881
I mean, my brother is--

00:09:07.965 --> 00:09:10.217
a vi-- vi-- vi--

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:12.678
ll l. ?

00:09:12.761 --> 00:09:15.389
He's... a virgin.

00:09:16.432 --> 00:09:19.268
Vi-vi-vi-vi-vi-vi--

00:09:20.978 --> 00:09:22.521
--Vi-vi-vi-vi-vi-vi--!

00:09:22.521 --> 00:09:23.605
--Cut it out!
--Vi-vi-vi-vi-vi-vi--!

00:09:23.689 --> 00:09:25.065
A virgin, you say?

00:09:25.149 --> 00:09:25.941
Yeah.

00:09:26.024 --> 00:09:29.361
A... a virgin...? But...

00:09:29.445 --> 00:09:33.198
You haven't done it with him, have you?

00:09:33.282 --> 00:09:34.533
L_l-l--_

00:09:34.616 --> 00:09:36.368
It's okay, Tsukimi.

00:09:36.452 --> 00:09:42.249
She only wants to trick Shu
and make a monkey out of him.

00:09:42.332 --> 00:09:43.834
We did it!

00:09:43.917 --> 00:09:48.005
Believe it or not, I've got a rep in
my neighborhood as a "virgin killer"!

00:09:48.088 --> 00:09:53.135
In Ichikawa over in Chiba, they
used to call me "Shoko the Christener"!

00:09:53.135 --> 00:09:53.969
"Ichikawa" "Chiba Prefecture"

00:09:53.969 --> 00:09:57.639
You're so lying. Nobody'd
make up that nickname these days.

00:09:57.723 --> 00:09:59.308
This is the 21st century, you know.

00:09:59.391 --> 00:10:02.936
I'm not lying! Fine, <i>I'll</i> show you, then!

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:06.732
Look, here's proof positive!

00:10:17.075 --> 00:10:18.660
Tsukimi!

00:10:21.997 --> 00:10:24.458
Mom... <i>What should</i> a <i>girl do</i>

00:10:24.541 --> 00:10:29.463
<i>when she's found out
something she never wanted to?</i>

00:10:29.546 --> 00:10:35.761
<i>What... What should she do if she
sees something she never wanted to?</i>

00:10:37.805 --> 00:10:44.645
<i>How... How can I erase
the memories from my head?</i>

00:10:44.728 --> 00:10:47.397
Not only the memory of what just happened...

00:10:47.481 --> 00:10:56.990
<i>Erase every single memory...
that has anything to do with him.</i>

00:11:10.295 --> 00:11:12.089
Tsukimi...

00:11:16.552 --> 00:11:17.970
It's cold.

00:11:18.554 --> 00:11:19.555
It's commercial time!

00:11:19.638 --> 00:11:20.848
Clara!

00:11:21.932 --> 00:11:23.100
It's the second half!

00:11:23.183 --> 00:11:23.976
Tequila!

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:33.068
Mom... Come to think of it...

00:11:33.151 --> 00:11:37.865
<i>Ever since I was little,
going to sleep and forgetting</i>

00:11:37.948 --> 00:11:41.243
<i>about bad things that happened
to me has been my specialty.</i>

00:11:42.578 --> 00:11:45.414
<i>Even if something bad happened at school...</i>

00:11:45.497 --> 00:11:47.958
Whatcha reading, Kurashita?

00:11:48.041 --> 00:11:50.544
Hey, what is this, a jellyfish?

00:11:50.627 --> 00:11:53.922
Ugh, that's gross!

00:11:54.006 --> 00:11:57.050
I'd <i>go</i> home by myself...

00:11:59.511 --> 00:12:01.346
Welcome home, Tsukimi.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:06.643
<i>I'd eat Mom's curry, she'd
peel me an apple for dessert,</i>

00:12:06.727 --> 00:12:10.522
I'd be full, and...

00:12:10.606 --> 00:12:13.775
<i>Gazing at a jellyfish
field guide at the kotatsu,</i>

00:12:13.859 --> 00:12:16.445
<i>before I knew it I'd manage to fall asleep.</i>

00:12:19.448 --> 00:12:22.993
<i>I'd doze off and dream of jellyfish.</i>

00:12:23.076 --> 00:12:28.498
<i>Dreams where I drifted
through the sea with so many jellies...</i>

00:12:30.792 --> 00:12:36.089
<i>There in the blue, blue sea...
It was like I was really floating.</i>

00:12:36.173 --> 00:12:40.260
<i>It was so much fun, and I felt happy...</i>

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:48.143
When <i>I</i> woke up, somehow
<i>I</i> was in my own bedroom.

00:12:48.226 --> 00:12:51.939
<i>Yeah. I'll go to sleep, like I used to.</i>

00:12:52.022 --> 00:12:56.193
<i>And dream of</i> a <i>jellyfish-filled sea...</i>

00:12:56.818 --> 00:13:02.866
Tsukimi! Tsukimi! Tsukimi! Tsukimi!

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:04.910
Yo! Good evening!

00:13:04.993 --> 00:13:08.121
Clara! Yay, let's swim together!

00:13:08.205 --> 00:13:11.959
Believe it or not, I'm an
expert at the butterfly stroke!

00:13:13.961 --> 00:13:16.672
Look, here's proof!

00:13:28.058 --> 00:13:29.309
Kuranosuke.

00:13:29.393 --> 00:13:31.728
Look! Look at this dress!

00:13:31.812 --> 00:13:34.690
Your papa gave it to me.

00:13:36.525 --> 00:13:39.486
But this color makes it almost
like a wedding dress, doesn't it?

00:13:39.569 --> 00:13:42.280
I know it'll look good on you, Mama!

00:13:42.364 --> 00:13:47.244
No. Only brides can wear those dresses.

00:13:47.327 --> 00:13:50.998
Your mama has lots and lots of dresses,

00:13:51.081 --> 00:13:54.710
but a wedding dress is the
one dress I've never worn.

00:14:09.641 --> 00:14:13.145
How about that, you're on to something.

00:14:13.228 --> 00:14:15.772
You're on to something, Tsukimi!

00:14:19.568 --> 00:14:21.445
Whoops, gotta cross-dress...

00:14:21.528 --> 00:14:24.489
What a pain! I'll just wear the wig.

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:31.413
Don't scowl at me like that.
All I did was tell the truth.

00:14:31.496 --> 00:14:35.417
I... I don't...

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:38.712
I don't believe I've united with you in spirit.

00:14:38.795 --> 00:14:41.423
Oh my God! I didn't see that one coming!

00:14:41.506 --> 00:14:45.469
Listen to you, all seriously denying that!

00:14:45.552 --> 00:14:47.345
Too funny!

00:14:52.017 --> 00:14:53.685
The night breeze is so refreshing.

00:14:53.769 --> 00:14:56.188
Please stop changing the subject.

00:14:56.271 --> 00:15:03.320
At any rate, as I said, I want you
to leave me alone once and for all.

00:15:03.403 --> 00:15:07.074
Shall I let you in on a little
secret you haven't figured out yet?

00:15:07.157 --> 00:15:08.408
Excuse me?

00:15:08.492 --> 00:15:11.203
The truth is...

00:15:11.286 --> 00:15:14.581
You like being under the
thumb of a woman like me.

00:15:14.664 --> 00:15:16.750
What are you talking about...?

00:15:16.833 --> 00:15:19.836
If you really thought of me as a
nuisance, you could just go home.

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:23.131
No one's forcing you to
sit here drinking tea with me.

00:15:23.215 --> 00:15:26.802
But here you are. And that's because...

00:15:26.885 --> 00:15:31.389
Deep down, you want
to have sex with me again.

00:15:40.607 --> 00:15:42.818
Thank you for coming!

00:15:44.027 --> 00:15:47.739
He really is a virgin... Well, damn.

00:15:48.865 --> 00:15:51.535
Now that's a relief!

00:15:51.618 --> 00:15:55.747
I'm sorry to have caused
you worry, Mr. Prime Minister.

00:15:55.831 --> 00:15:57.624
Oh, nonsense.

00:15:57.707 --> 00:16:01.795
But this is a serious
problem for today's society.

00:16:01.878 --> 00:16:05.132
Thanks to the Equal Employment
Opportunity Law for Men and Women,

00:16:05.215 --> 00:16:09.970
more women are entering the job
market, meaning they delay marriage...

00:16:10.053 --> 00:16:14.599
The percentage of Japan's men
who are unmarried is above 40 now.

00:16:14.683 --> 00:16:16.893
So I'm really glad...

00:16:18.562 --> 00:16:21.273
...that Shu's been able
to cast off his virginity!

00:16:21.356 --> 00:16:27.279
Yes. And the lady is quite seasoned;
the perfect type to christen a man.

00:16:27.362 --> 00:16:31.533
Aha! Even better!

00:16:31.616 --> 00:16:34.953
So, what's her type?
Nightclub type? Teenybopper type?

00:16:35.036 --> 00:16:37.706
The OL type? The plain type?
The dating service type?

00:16:37.789 --> 00:16:40.125
The type who tweets everything on Twitter?

00:16:40.208 --> 00:16:45.172
Well, the thing is...
Apparently it's that redeveloper.

00:16:49.134 --> 00:16:51.970
D-Doesn't that complicate things?

00:16:52.053 --> 00:16:54.514
Yes, it does.

00:16:54.598 --> 00:16:57.559
Sol plan to send Shu abroad
soon on a tour of inspection,

00:16:57.642 --> 00:17:01.980
and have Hanamori
investigate her while he's gone.

00:17:02.063 --> 00:17:04.774
And there's actually one more...

00:17:04.858 --> 00:17:07.527
One more girl I'm concerned about...

00:17:09.237 --> 00:17:11.239
Whoa, there are two?!

00:17:11.323 --> 00:17:12.908
Hey, like father, like son!

00:17:12.991 --> 00:17:14.367
--You've got the womanizing gene!

00:17:14.367 --> 00:17:15.827
“Thanks.
--You've got the womanizing gene!

00:17:15.911 --> 00:17:20.248
Oh, Prime Minister, I didn't know you were here.

00:17:20.248 --> 00:17:20.332
"Ba-dum..."

00:17:20.332 --> 00:17:23.877
Shu-Shu, there's something
different about you today!

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:26.171
Did you climb the stairway to adulthood?

00:17:26.254 --> 00:17:28.048
Excuse me?

00:17:28.465 --> 00:17:30.467
<i>I</i> can't sleep.

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:33.470
<i>When I squeeze my eyes
shut and try to fall asleep,</i>

00:17:33.553 --> 00:17:40.769
<i>everything I saw just keeps playing
like a slideshow behind my eyelids...</i>

00:17:40.852 --> 00:17:44.231
<i>It hurts so, so much, and I can't sleep!</i>

00:17:44.231 --> 00:17:44.940
"Ms. Mejiro, what should I do
if I want to sleep but I can't...?"

00:17:45.232 --> 00:17:47.943
I humbly request your decree!

00:17:53.657 --> 00:17:54.366
"Booze."

00:18:02.082 --> 00:18:04.459
A lock picker?!

00:18:04.542 --> 00:18:06.378
Lock! Picker! Lock picker lock!

00:18:06.461 --> 00:18:09.130
What, a thief? Leave it to me, man!

00:18:09.214 --> 00:18:11.591
Oho! What's your secret plan?

00:18:11.675 --> 00:18:15.262
The only alcohol we have is cooking wine.

00:18:15.345 --> 00:18:18.098
Oh, well. Maybe I'll go
to the convenience store...

00:18:23.979 --> 00:18:25.939
A woman's voice!

00:18:27.732 --> 00:18:28.566
Tsukimi?!

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:32.028
Tsukimi, you fool, how dare you burgle us!

00:18:32.112 --> 00:18:34.239
I raised you better than that!

00:18:34.322 --> 00:18:37.993
N-N-N-No! I just w-w-wanted a drink!

00:18:38.076 --> 00:18:40.954
A drink?! So alcohol
drove you to this dark deed?!

00:18:41.037 --> 00:18:45.083
And you're underage, too!
That's a serious matter in its own right!

00:18:45.166 --> 00:18:48.420
L-I'm sorry! It's just that I can't sleep,

00:18:48.503 --> 00:18:50.338
and I thought maybe
drinking a little would help!

00:18:50.422 --> 00:18:53.800
What?! Well, why didn't you say so?!

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:55.927
" Kantei "

00:18:55.927 --> 00:18:56.219
Here, drink up!

00:18:56.303 --> 00:19:00.640
Guan Yu's spirit may dwell within
this lettering! It is a precious gift!

00:19:00.724 --> 00:19:03.935
But though it comes in a bottle
of that magnificent Shaoxing wine,

00:19:04.019 --> 00:19:08.106
the sake inside is just some sweet
sake from our cowardly neighbors...

00:19:08.189 --> 00:19:10.942
In that case, no need to hesitate!

00:19:11.026 --> 00:19:13.987
Okay, try one glass for starters.

00:19:15.905 --> 00:19:18.408
Look at her drink!

00:19:18.491 --> 00:19:21.328
Sunk by mere sweet sake? Surely you jest!

00:19:21.411 --> 00:19:23.455
Sweet sake's hardly even real sake!

00:19:23.538 --> 00:19:25.290
What's all this fuss about?

00:19:25.373 --> 00:19:29.169
Were you the ones who took
my girls without permission?

00:19:29.252 --> 00:19:31.880
E-Er, there's a profound reason for this...

00:19:31.963 --> 00:19:34.924
Honestly! You'd better be
sure to return the others as well!

00:19:35.008 --> 00:19:36.885
Okay, okay.

00:19:36.968 --> 00:19:40.722
Oh, Tsukimi, you shouldn't be sleeping here.

00:19:40.805 --> 00:19:43.600
Honestly... What am I going to do with you?

00:19:46.936 --> 00:19:52.484
Tsukimi... Tsukimi... Tsukimi... Tsukimi!

00:19:53.151 --> 00:19:55.362
Clara?

00:19:55.445 --> 00:19:58.615
Are you okay? Did you catch a cold?

00:19:58.698 --> 00:20:01.743
Yeah, I think I might be a little feverish...

00:20:01.826 --> 00:20:04.037
But that's fine, if it helps me sleep.

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:06.873
Because then I can forget the bad things...

00:20:06.956 --> 00:20:08.875
What "bad things"?

00:20:08.958 --> 00:20:12.504
Um... what were they, again?

00:20:12.587 --> 00:20:15.298
Maybe I forgot them when I fell asleep!

00:20:15.382 --> 00:20:18.009
Really? That's good!

00:20:18.093 --> 00:20:19.260
Yep!

00:20:19.344 --> 00:20:24.766
Now come swim to the East
China Sea with me! Hey, come on!

00:20:25.975 --> 00:20:30.397
Wow, it's a brood of Japanese
sea nettles! Look how many there are!

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:34.526
Japanese sea nettles are highly
poisonous. Be careful, Tsukimi!

00:20:34.609 --> 00:20:36.403
Right!

00:20:40.573 --> 00:20:44.285
So pretty... Like a princess's dresses!

00:20:44.369 --> 00:20:50.834
Huh? I feel warm, somehow...
and like my body is floating...

00:20:50.917 --> 00:20:53.545
I feel really good, somehow!

00:20:53.628 --> 00:20:56.965
Oh, I see.

00:20:57.048 --> 00:21:01.761
<i>Mom is picking me up and carrying me to bed.</i>

00:21:03.763 --> 00:21:05.557
Mom...

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:19.404
Jeez, you're heavy.

00:21:21.281 --> 00:21:30.290
<i>I really want you to
realize that you're gorgeous</i>

00:21:30.373 --> 00:21:34.711
<i>Why haven't you realized it before this?</i>

00:21:34.794 --> 00:21:39.215
<i>It's like you've lost your heart</i>

00:21:39.299 --> 00:21:48.391
<i>I</i> want you to realize <i>it</i> right away,
right away, <i>I</i> want you to understand

00:21:48.475 --> 00:22:02.864
<i>I want you to realize it right</i> away,
<i>I want you to realize your beauty</i>

00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:08.703
<i>Because you're so very beautiful</i>

00:22:08.786 --> 00:22:12.790
<i>I want to convey that to you</i>

00:22:12.874 --> 00:22:22.467
<i>Your loveliness, forever and ever</i>

00:22:22.550 --> 00:22:30.892
<i>I'll be so happy if you'll
just realize your loveliness</i>

00:22:30.975 --> 00:22:35.688
<i>I</i> care about you, you know

00:22:35.772 --> 00:22:45.031
Please, realize your beauty
